# Typed into go-uefi.img on q35 under OVMF (make reboot-smoke's second
# half, W28-S04): the console's reboot through the FADT's reset register
# (q35 has one), OVMF boots the disk again, then poweroff through ACPI.
wait burrow>
type reboot
key ret
wait [nucleus] reset:
wait BURROW:GO:OK
wait burrow>
type poweroff
key ret
